See Divisors, Definition <a href="/tag/063J" data-tag="063J">31.22.1</a>. Observe that regular immersions are the same thing as Koszul-regular immersions or quasi-regular immersions for locally Noetherian schemes, see Divisors, Lemma <a href="/tag/063L" data-tag="063L">31.22.3</a>. We will use this without further mention in this section.